      "stdout": "lyra-cli — Jianying/Capcut CLI tool.\r\n> To edit Draft seamlessly with Jianying/CapCut from the command line.\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n  -v,     --version           Show version information and exit.\r\n          --jq TEXT           Pretty-print JSON output; with an optional selector like\r\n                              .result.items[0].id, output the selected JSON value instead of\r\n                              the full schema envelope.\r\n\r\nCLI management:\r\n  auth                        Authenticate with Lyra account\r\n  upgrade                     Upgrade lyra-cli to the latest version.\r\n\r\nLYRA DOMAINS:\r\n  draft                       Manage / Edit Jianying/Capcut drafts.\r\n  material                    Search and download materials (stickers, audio, ...) from the\r\n                              Jianying/Capcut platform.\r\n  media                       Local media processing tasks / AIGC media tasks.\r\n  lint                        Validate lyra-cli command contracts and acceptance evidence.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  $ lyra-cli auth login\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft project create --ref local://example\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft video add --resource local:///x/y.mp4\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft algo subtitle-recognize --language zh\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft blueprint apply --workspace ./bp_ws --ref local://example\r\n  $ lyra-cli media compress --input /tmp/in.mp4 --output /tmp/out.mp4 --width 1280 --height 720\r\n  $ lyra-cli media trim-video --input /tmp/in.mp4 --output /tmp/clip.mp4 --start 1s --end 5s\r\n  $ lyra-cli media asr --input /tmp/speech.m4a --language auto\r\n  $ lyra-cli material search --type sticker --prompt \"flower\"\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE\r\n  Use `lyra-cli <command> <subcommand> --help` for more information about a command.\r\n",
